  "term": "hemisphere",
  "definition": "In cognition research, a hemisphere is one of the brain’s two sides, the left or the right. Studies of hemisphere asymmetry examine whether one side plays a stronger role than the other in tasks such as recognizing facial expressions and processing emotion.",
